      "text": "sons of Lehi1 return to Jerusalem to bring Ishmael and family into wilderness, 1 Ne. 7:2. the Lord softens heart of Ishmael, 1 Ne. 7:4–5. part of Ishmael’s family pleads with rebellious brethren, 1 Ne. 7:19. house of Ishmael joins family of Lehi1 in thanking God and offering sacrifice, 1 Ne. 7:22. Zoram1 and sons of Lehi1 marry Ishmael’s daughters, 1 Ne. 16:7. dies, 1 Ne. 16:34.",
